# Coin Launcher Map

Scope: `coin-launcher/src/` only. Generated 2026-11-19 from commit `f33514a4`.

The coin-launcher is a Fastify service (port **3002**). It accepts a token launch request as multipart form data and puts it on a BullMQ queue (Redis). A worker in the same process then runs the full launch pipeline:
derive keys (wallet-app) → upload image + metadata (Irys/Arweave) → create SPL mint → attach Metaplex metadata → mint supply (+ optional authority revoke) → create Meteora CP-AMM pool → optional Jupiter auto-buys → persist to Postgres (`tb_tokens`).

