## 3. Data Flow

### 3.1 Request lifecycle

```
Client ──► api-gateway ──(x-user-id header)──► coin-launcher :3002
                                                   │
           POST /launch/newToken (multipart)       │
           launchSetup.ts                          ▼
             parse parts → imageBuffer + fields → LaunchJobData
             imageBuffer serialized as number[] (Redis-safe JSON)
             launchQueue.add("token-launch-queue", jobData)
             ◄── 202 { jobId }
                                                   │
                                     Redis (redis-dev:6379)
                                                   │
                                                   ▼
           launchWorker (launchInitializer.ts) picks up job
                                                   │
           GET /launch/status/:jobId  ◄── polled by client
           launchStatus.ts → launchQueue.getJob → { progress, value, failed, state }
```

### 3.2 Worker pipeline (`launchWorker`, `service_functionality/launchInitializer.ts`)

| # | Progress % / step text | Action | Function / external | Produces |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | none | Derive funding keypair | POST wallet-app `/internal/derive` (`wallet_type: "funding"`) | `fundingKeypair { publicKey, secretKey[] }` |
| 0 | none | Look up fee wallet pubkey | GET wallet-app `/internal/listPublicKey` | `feeWalletData` (**unused**) |
| 0 | none | *If auto-buy:* slave balance preflight | GET `/internal/listPublicKey` → `connectionRPC.getBalance` | Throws if `balance < solPerBuy × numberOfBuys × 1e9` |
| 1 | 10 `Uploading image to Arweave...` | Upload image | `irys.uploadImage(buffer, mimeType, secretKey)` | `imageURL` |
| 2 | 20 `Uploading metadata...` | Build + upload JSON metadata | `irys.uploadMetadata(metaData, secretKey)` | `metaDataURI` |
| 3 | 35 `Creating mint account...` | Create SPL mint | `solana.createTokenMint(decimals, fundingKeypair)` | `mintAddress`, `mintTxSig` |
| 3b | none | Mint readability poll (5 × 2s) | `connectionRPC.getAccountInfo` | Throws on RPC sync failure |
| 4 | 50 `Attaching metadata...` | Metaplex metadata account | `solana.attachMetadata(...)` | `metadataTxSig` (Uint8Array → stored as **base64**) |
| 5 | 65 `Minting supply...` | Create ATA, mint full supply, optional revoke | `solana.mintSupply(...)` | Return value not used |
| 6 | 75 `Creating liquidity pool...` | Meteora CP-AMM pool (token/WSOL) | `meteora.createPool(...)` | `poolAddress`, `poolPosition`, `launchTxSig`, `positionNftMint` |
| 7 | 85–94 `Auto-buy i of n...` | *If auto-buy:* supply-cap check on 1 quote, derive slave key, `n` swaps | `jupiterSwap.getQuote`, `validateSupplyPercent`, POST `/internal/derive` (`slave`), `autoBuy` ×n | Swap tx sigs (not persisted) |
| 8 | 95 `Finalizing...` | Insert DB row | `pool.query(INSERT INTO tb_tokens ...)` | Row |
| 9 | none | Job result | none | `{ mintAddress, poolAddress }`, or `{ error: "Token launch failed at DB insert" }` |

Derived amounts:
- `tokenBAmountLamports = floor(initialLiquiditySol × 1e9)` (SOL side of the pool)
- `tokenAAmountBaseUnits = floor(supply × poolPercentage/100) × 10^decimals` (token side of the pool)
- `solPerBuyLamports = floor(solPerBuy × 1e9)`

### 3.3 Keys / money flow

```
funding wallet  ── pays ──► Irys funding (image + metadata upload fees)
                ── pays ──► mint account rent + tx fees
                ── is ────► mint authority (revoked if revoke=true), metadata update authority + creator (100%)
                ── holds ─► 100% of minted supply in its ATA
                ── deposits► poolPercentage% of supply + initialLiquiditySol into the Meteora pool
                            (fundingWallet = payer + creator; position NFT keypair generated per launch)
slave wallet    ── swaps ─► SOL → new token via Jupiter, numberOfBuys × solPerBuy
fee wallet      ── only its ID is stored in tb_tokens (fee_wallet_id). position_tx_sig is NULL and reserved for
                   a later funding→fee position ownership transfer
```

### 3.4 Persisted record: `tb_tokens`

| Column | Source |
|---|---|
| user_id | `job.data.userId` (header `x-user-id`) |
| fee_wallet_id | `job.data.feeWalletId` |
| funding_wallet_id | `job.data.fundingWalletId` |
| mint_address | `createTokenMint` |
| name, symbol, decimals, supply | form fields |
| metadata_uri | `uploadMetadata` |
| image_uri | `uploadImage` |
| metadata_tx_sig | `attachMetadata` signature, base64-encoded |
| pool_address | `createPool.poolAddress` |
| position_address | `createPool.poolPosition` |
| position_nft_mint | `createPool.positionNftMint` |
| position_tx_sig | `NULL` (reserved) |
| launch_tx_sig | `createPool.launchTxSig` |
| website, twitter, telegram | form fields |
| launched_at | `now()` |

